Hi again, 

I can't see the problem:
Your data are:
## original
> datCasted
  ind       l       m
1   1 108/110 110/110
2   2 116/114  90/111
3   3 122/152 122/128
4   4 119/122  69/128

## after conversion
> genind2df(gi,sep="-")
        l       m
1 108-110 110-110
2 114-116 090-111
3 122-152 122-128
4 119-122 069-128

## propShared
> propShared(gi)
  1 2   3   4
1 1 0 0.0 0.0
2 0 1 0.0 0.0
3 0 0 1.0 0.5
4 0 0 0.5 1.0

Which is exactly the expected result (the proportion of identical alleles between pairs of genotypes). 

Cheers

Thibaut


